      "AMD-0000002488-26-000191": "same checks pass on a different issuer, showing the rule is not NVDA-specific"
    }
  },
  "scope_check": "Edits only prompts/gen-writer/candidate-change-002.md (references/policies.md section 5). failure.json acceptance checks unchanged; evaluation not weakened.",
  "unresolved": "Sensitivity magnitudes that have no values.json key (cmp-004 band margins and WACC thresholds) will now be described qualitatively or dropped, which loses some precision; exposing them as keys would require a code change outside this change's scope. The examples in the rule quote NVDA evidence wording; the held-out AMD case tests whether the rule generalises rather than memorises."
}
EOF
